sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor F as Foydalanuvchi
  participant B as Brauzer (Angular)
  participant API as AuthController
  participant S as AuthService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant M as SMTP
  F->>B: E-pochta manzilini kiritadi
  B->>API: POST /api/auth/request-code
  API->>S: RequestSignInCodeAsync(email, IP)
  S->>DB: Oxirgi kod va so‘rovlar sonini tekshirish
  Note over S: 1 daqiqada 1 ta, 15 daqiqada 5 tagacha
  S->>S: 6 xonali kod yaratish, PBKDF2-SHA256 xeshi
  S->>DB: email_verification_codes (faqat xesh)
  S->>M: Kodni yuborish
  API-->>B: 202 Accepted
  F->>B: Kodni kiritadi
  B->>API: POST /api/auth/verify-code
  API->>S: VerifySignInCodeAsync
  S->>DB: Kod xeshini solishtirish, AttemptCount++
  alt Yangi foydalanuvchi
    S-->>B: registrationToken (HMAC imzoli)
    B->>API: POST /api/auth/register (username, ism)
    API->>S: RegisterAsync
    S->>DB: users va sessions yozuvlari
  else Mavjud foydalanuvchi
    S->>DB: sessions yozuvi (qurilma, IP)
  end
  S-->>API: Access token (JWT) va refresh token
  API-->>B: JWT (javob tanasida) va HttpOnly cookie (refresh)
